{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.PartitionOfComposition","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PartitionOfComposition","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.PartitionLex","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.List.Sort"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PartitionOfComposition.colLen_ofComposition_garnir_example_high","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PartitionOfComposition.colLen_ofComposition_garnir_example_high","kind":"theorem","line":157,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PartitionOfComposition.lean#L157-L161","doc":"…and nothing above `4`, which is the other hypothesis `lexGt_of_colLen` wants. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PartitionOfComposition.colLen_ofComposition_garnir_example","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PartitionOfComposition.colLen_ofComposition_garnir_example","kind":"theorem","line":150,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PartitionOfComposition.lean#L150-L155","doc":"`(1,4,1)` has exactly one part above `3`, so its diagram's column `3` has one cell\n— the `4` that makes `(4,1,1)` lex-greater than `(3,3)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PartitionOfComposition.colLen_eq_countP_rowLens","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PartitionOfComposition.colLen_eq_countP_rowLens","kind":"theorem","line":131,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PartitionOfComposition.lean#L131-L140","doc":"**The bridge, for an arbitrary diagram**: column `m` is as tall as the diagram has\nrows longer than `m`.\n\nThis is the form `PartitionLex.lexGt_of_colLen` consumes: both of its hypotheses\nbecome counting statements about `μ.rowLens`, and the Garnir list differs from that\nin three entries. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PartitionOfComposition.ofComposition_rowLens","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PartitionOfComposition.ofComposition_rowLens","kind":"theorem","line":125,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PartitionOfComposition.lean#L125-L129","doc":"Reading a diagram's row lengths back as a composition returns the diagram. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PartitionOfComposition.sortDesc_eq_self","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PartitionOfComposition.sortDesc_eq_self","kind":"theorem","line":121,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PartitionOfComposition.lean#L121-L123","doc":"Sorting a weakly-decreasing list does nothing. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PartitionOfComposition.colLen_ofComposition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PartitionOfComposition.colLen_ofComposition","kind":"theorem","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PartitionOfComposition.lean#L102-L112","doc":"**The bridge.**  A composition's diagram has, in column `m`, exactly as many cells\nas the composition has parts exceeding `m`.\n\nThe right-hand side does not mention the sort, and `countP` is permutation-invariant,\nso this is a fact about the composition as written. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PartitionOfComposition.lt_countP_iff_of_sorted","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PartitionOfComposition.lt_countP_iff_of_sorted","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PartitionOfComposition.lean#L47-L100","doc":"On a weakly-decreasing list the entries exceeding `m` form an initial segment, so\n\"index `i` has an entry exceeding `m`\" and \"`i` is below the count of such entries\"\nare the same condition.\n\nThis is the only place sortedness is used; everything downstream is `countP`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PartitionOfComposition.ofComposition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PartitionOfComposition.ofComposition","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PartitionOfComposition.lean#L39-L45","doc":"**A composition as a Young diagram**: sort its parts and read them as row lengths.\n\nZero parts are harmless — they sort to the end and contribute no cells — so a\ncomposition with a zero part, which the Garnir splitting produces whenever `j = 0`,\nneeds no special handling. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PartitionOfComposition.sortDesc_perm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PartitionOfComposition.sortDesc_perm","kind":"theorem","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PartitionOfComposition.lean#L36-L37","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PartitionOfComposition.sortDesc_sorted","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PartitionOfComposition.sortDesc_sorted","kind":"theorem","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PartitionOfComposition.lean#L33-L34","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PartitionOfComposition.sortDesc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PartitionOfComposition.sortDesc","kind":"def","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PartitionOfComposition.lean#L30-L31","doc":"The parts of a list, sorted weakly decreasing. ","signatureChunk":0}]}